# Bias exploration toward a target, softly: local paths heading toward it and
# global frontiers nearer to it are preferred, nothing is excluded. For a goal
# the robot has no known route to yet. The caller clears it (active = false)
# once the goal is routable, given up or superseded.
bool active
# In the planner's world frame.
geometry_msgs/Point target
---
bool success
string message
